<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of matches on the</p>
<p>opening weekend of the Argentine Apertura championship:</p>
<p> Estudiantes	    2   Boca Juniors	  3</p>
<p> Ferro Carril Oeste   0   Independiente	 3</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy	 1   Platense		0</p>
<p> Huracan		  0   Lanus		   0</p>
<p> Huracan-Corrientes   3   Union		   6</p>
<p> Newell's Old Boys    0   Velez Sarsfield     2</p>
<p> Racing Club	    0   Rosario Central     2</p>
<p> River Plate	    0   Gimnasia-La Plata   0</p>
<p> San Lorenzo	    0   Banfield		1</p>
<p>Playing Monday: Deportivo Espanol v Colon</p>
<p>Note: the Apertura is the first of two championships played</p>
<p>in the Argentine season. The teams meet each other once in each</p>
<p>tournament. There is no overall champion.</p>
</text>
